+Gatekeeper audit → enforce workflow
+
+1. Install Gatekeeper (example):
+   helm repo add gatekeeper https://open-policy-agent.github.io/gatekeeper/charts
+   helm install gatekeeper gatekeeper/gatekeeper --namespace gatekeeper-system --create-namespace
+
+2. Deploy ConstraintTemplates and Constraints in audit mode first:
+   - Ensure constraints.spec.enforcementAction is set to "dryrun" or Gatekeeper is in audit mode.
+   - Observe violations for 48–72h and remediate.
+
+3. Flip to enforce:
+   - Update constraints.spec.enforcementAction = "deny"
+   - Or use Gatekeeper CLI to switch modes.
+
+Notes:
+- Do not flip to enforce until CI cosign and webhook enforcement are in place to avoid false blocks.
+
